    "rationale": "The 87-char `public_key` decodes to 65 bytes. It names the same curve point as the sender AID, but it is not the permitted encoding (§3.3) and is not byte-equal to the AID's 33-byte compressed key (§3.2 step 2). A verifier that decompresses both sides and compares points would accept; that is the defect this fixture catches."
